# BF16 flat-drain regression for the Scratchpad writer-len revert (9eb04f3 guard removed), MxAllAsymGemminiRocketConfig only.
# Every test reads its BF16 result back via the flat spad->DRAM drain whose per-row length the revert
# changes. Requant and llama tests excluded. Build ELFs: ../../software/gemmini-rocc-tests/build_mx_rocket.sh bareMetalC
